Package: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-tearfree-modesetting
Version: 1.7-3
Section: oldlibs
Priority: optional
Architecture: all
Depends: devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting, devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting-atomic
Maintainer: Bob Rosbag <debian@bobrosbag.nl>
Description: Transitional package for devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting
 This package removes the old X11 device section
 /etc/X11/xorg.conf.d/20-modesetting.conf and pulls in
 devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting and
 devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-modesetting-atomic. Variable refresh rate is no
 longer enabled; install devjam-gpu-x11-xlibre-vrr for it. It can be
 removed safely.
